{"id": "382dbe96-6f98-4e3f-b13a-5159db0b2344", "slug": "aether-convergence-of-intelligence", "title": "Aether — Convergence of Intelligence", "description": "Aether Convergence Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Aether — Convergence of Intelligence\"\ndescription: \"Aether Convergence Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#B1E09D\"\n  secondary: \"#061C15\"\n  accent: \"#82A89C\"\n  background: \"#B1E09D\"\n  surface: \"#061C15\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#D1DEDC\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Plus Jakarta Sans\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Playfair Display\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"32px\"\n  control: \"48px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Aether — Convergence of Intelligence\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sakura DesignCode (@sakura-designcode). Views: 50; favorites: 7; remixes: 0.\nTags: login, animated, input, validation, security.\n## Overview\nAether Convergence Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nAether Platform Manifesto Integrations Network Access Portal Observe Convergence Velocity of Risk Real-time Quantitative Drift Our consensus-driven layers synthesize global liquidity trends and sovereign shifts to forti…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Convergence; Direct Infinite Variables with Calibrated Precision; Symbiotic Pipelines Designed for Scale; Co-Evolutionary Capital Systems.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #B1E09D, secondary #061C15, accent #82A89C, background #B1E09D, surface #061C15, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Plus Jakarta Sans for display moments and Playfair Display for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Aether — Convergence of Intelligence</title>\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <!-- Iconify Script -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <!-- Google Fonts for Editorial Elegance -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&amp;family=Syne:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #f3faf9;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n        }\n        .font-display {\n            font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;\n        }\n        .font-serif-custom {\n            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n            width: 6px;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n            background: #f3faf9;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n            background: #d1dedc;\n            border-radius: 3px;\n        }\n        .vertical-text {\n            writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n            transform: rotate(180deg);\n        }\n        .reveal {\n            opacity: 0;\n            transform: translateY(20px);\n            filter: blur(8px);\n            transition: all 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n        }\n        .reveal.active {\n            opacity: 1;\n            transform: translateY(0);\n            filter: blur(0);\n        }\n        @keyframes mesh-pulse {\n            0% { transform: translate(0px, 0px) scale(1); }\n            33% { transform: translate(30px, -50px) scale(1.1); }\n            66% { transform: translate(-20px, 20px) scale(0.95); }\n            100% { transform: translate(0px, 0px) scale(1); }\n        }\n        .animate-mesh-1 {\n            animation: mesh-pulse 15s infinite ease-in-out;\n        }\n        .animate-mesh-2 {\n            animation: mesh-pulse 20s infinite ease-in-out 2s;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"text-[#050505] antialiased selection:bg-[#b1e09d] selection:text-black\">\n\n    <!-- Glowing Background WebGL Ambient Simulation -->\n    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-[120vh] overflow-hidden pointer-events-none z-0\">\n        <div class=\"absolute top-[-20%] left-[10%] w-[60vw] h-[60vw] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#e5fcf4] to-[#cbf7e6] mix-blend-multiply filter blur-[120px] opacity-70 animate-mesh-1\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-[10%] right-[-10%] w-[50vw] h-[50vw] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#e0f7f3] to-[#d6f0ea] mix-blend-multiply filter blur-[140px] opacity-60 animate-mesh-2\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Navigation Bar -->\n    <header class=\"relative z-50 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 flex items-center justify-between reveal\">\n        <!-- Logo Branding -->\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-3 group\">\n            <svg class=\"w-8 h-8 text-black transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:rotate-180\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"45\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 6\"></circle>\n                <path d=\"M50 20 V80 M20 50 H80\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n                <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle>\n            </svg>\n            <span class=\"font-display font-semibold text-lg tracking-tight uppercase\">Aether</span>\n        </a>\n\n        <!-- Middle Menu links -->\n        <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-10\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium hover:text-gray-500 transition-colors\">Platform</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium hover:text-gray-500 transition-colors\">Manifesto</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium hover:text-gray-500 transition-colors\">Integrations</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium hover:text-gray-500 transition-colors\">Network</a>\n        </nav>\n\n        <!-- CTA Buttons -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-[#b1e09d] hover:bg-[#9fd08a] transition-all duration-300\">Access Portal</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-[#050505] text-white hover:bg-gray-800 transition-all duration-300 flex items-center gap-2 group\">\n                Observe\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-sm transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Wrapper -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\">\n\n        <!-- HERO SECTION -->\n        <section class=\"pt-12 pb-20\">\n            <!-- Giant Responsive Headline -->\n            <div class=\"reveal overflow-hidden\">\n                <h1 class=\"font-display font-semibold text-[11vw] leading-none tracking-tighter text-center md:text-left select-none\">\n                    Convergence\n                </h1>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Multi-Column Context Grid -->\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 md:gap-4 mt-8 items-start reveal\">\n\n                <!-- Col 1: Avatars Stack & Faster Reporting Info -->\n                <div class=\"col-span-1 md:col-span-3 flex flex-col items-center md:items-start gap-4\">\n                    <div class=\"flex -space-x-4\">\n                        <img class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-4 border-[#f3faf9] object-cover hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\" src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/f40f03d0-8722-42a1-bf75-89d9deb07d7f_3840w.jpg\" alt=\"Team member\">\n                        <img class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-4 border-[#f3faf9] object-cover hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\" src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/77415a2e-dcbc-4748-a29d-fced4821881a_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Team member\">\n                        <img class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-4 border-[#f3faf9] object-cover hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\" src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/c92852bb-a510-405a-85ab-ffa0fde136a4_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Team member\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-center md:text-left\">\n                        <p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400\">Velocity of Risk</p>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Real-time Quantitative Drift</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Col 2: Context Paragraph -->\n                <div class=\"col-span-1 md:col-span-3 text-center md:text-left\">\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed max-w-xs mx-auto md:mx-0\">\n                        Our consensus-driven layers synthesize global liquidity trends and sovereign shifts to fortify capital structures autonomously.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Col 3: Elegant Curved Organic Thumbnail -->\n                <div class=\"col-span-1 md:col-span-2 flex justify-center md:justify-start\">\n                    <div class=\"w-24 h-24 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 relative group shadow-sm\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#16352b]/10 mix-blend-multiply group-hover:opacity-0 transition-opacity\"></div>\n                        <img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/91a69d34-7bfd-4a15-802d-67ddeff8c160_3840w.webp\" alt=\"Nature curve abstract\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Col 4: Action Heading Text -->\n                <div class=\"col-span-1 md:col-span-4 text-center md:text-left\">\n                    <h3 class=\"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-900 leading-tight\">\n                        Direct Infinite Variables with Calibrated Precision\n                    </h3>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- LARGE FEATURE BANNER & FLOATING WIDGET -->\n        <section class=\"relative rounded-[32px] md:rounded-[48px] overflow-hidden min-h-[500px] md:min-h-[700px] flex items-end p-6 md:p-12 reveal shadow-lg bg-emerald-950\">\n\n            <!-- Elegant High-Res Architectural Background from Aura library -->\n            <video src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779252795876-2b1a5a6f-b3d8-4bd6-9bc8-f9df9cb41c3b.mp4\" poster=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779245544000-b2ff109c-9997-43aa-8fd5-ed625b5d3b76.png\" data-neuform-generated-video=\"true\" data-neuform-video-preset=\"loop-in-view\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" preload=\"metadata\" loop=\"\" aria-label=\"Future landscape visual\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-90 transition-transform duration-1000 hover:scale-105\"></video>\n\n            <!-- Gradient Shade for Readability -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 via-transparent to-black/20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Floating Premium Card with Gradient Border -->\n            <div class=\"relative z-20 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 max-w-lg w-full flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start md:items-center justify-between shadow-2xl transform hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"border: 1px solid transparent; border-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)) 1;\">\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-5\">\n                    <!-- Embedded Visual Abstract Square inside Glass Box -->\n                    <div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 bg-black relative group\">\n                        <img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\" src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/bfef5098-c30f-4cd9-b4ac-04b2673ab943_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"abstract visual\">\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-700 font-semibold\">Predictive Engine v4.2</span>\n                        <h4 class=\"font-display text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-950 leading-snug\">\n                            Symbiotic Pipelines Designed for Scale\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Multi-layered consensus-driven asset allocation</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Circular Interactive Dynamic Button -->\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-gray-200 flex items-center justify-center bg-gray-50 hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 flex-shrink-0 group\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-xl transform group-hover:rotate-45 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- ETHOS & VALUES OVERLAPPING SECTION (Surgically colored deep-green to fulfill user directive) -->\n    <section class=\"bg-[#071d16] text-[#e1f5ee] py-32 mt-24 relative overflow-hidden\">\n\n        <!-- Deep Emerald Ambient Glow -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-[-10%] left-[-20%] w-[50vw] h-[50vw] rounded-full bg-[#183a2f]/40 filter blur-[100px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10\">\n\n            <!-- Headers and ethos intro -->\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-end mb-20 reveal\">\n                <div class=\"lg:col-span-8\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#82a89c]\">Architectural Stewardship</span>\n                    <h2 class=\"font-display font-medium text-4xl md:text-6xl tracking-tight leading-none mt-4 text-[#e1f5ee]\">\n                        Co-Evolutionary Capital Systems\n                    </h2>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"lg:col-span-4\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[#82a89c] text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-sm\">\n                        By synchronizing highly calibrated predictive engines with generational safety barriers, we establish a new standard for enduring wealth.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Overlapping & Tilting Custom Bookmarks in matching Mint & Sage Green tones -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-6 lg:gap-3 py-10 select-none\">\n\n                <!-- Bookmark 1 (Mint-Cream Vertical Title Card) -->\n                <div class=\"w-full max-w-[280px] h-[520px] bg-[#e8f7f2] text-[#061c15] rounded-xl shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between p-6 transform rotate-[-2deg] hover:rotate-0 hover:-translate-y-6 transition-all duration-500 cursor-pointer group\" style=\"border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-serif-custom italic font-medium\">03 // Genesis</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-[#82a89c] group-hover:rotate-90 transition-transform duration-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Vertical Text Wrapper -->\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-center items-center flex-grow py-8\">\n                        <div class=\"vertical-text font-serif-custom text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight whitespace-nowrap opacity-90 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\">\n                            Mutual Horizon\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end border-t border-[#061c15]/10 pt-4\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold\">Synergistic Ledger</span>\n                        <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#061c15]\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Bookmark 2 (Sage Green Detailed Manifesto Card) -->\n                <div class=\"w-full max-w-[280px] h-[520px] bg-[#7aa897] text-[#061c15] rounded-xl shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between p-6 transform rotate-[1.5deg] hover:rotate-0 hover:-translate-y-6 transition-all duration-500 cursor-pointer group\" style=\"border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-serif-custom italic font-medium\">Ethos</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest opacity-60\">Manifesto</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 py-6\">\n                        <p class=\"font-serif-custom text-sm md:text-md leading-relaxed text-[#061c15] opacity-95\">\n                            We map optimal vectors with community alignment in mind. Every infrastructure blueprint returns up to 140% localized value.\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"font-serif-custom text-sm md:text-md leading-relaxed text-[#061c15] opacity-95\">\n                            We favor robust, long-term stability over fragile immediate leverage. Systemic integrity remains our ultimate directive.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end border-t border-[#061c15]/10 pt-4\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-serif-custom italic\">Aether Philosophy</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:info-circle-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-[#061c15]/80\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Bookmark 3 (Mint-Cream Vertical Title Card) -->\n                <div class=\"w-full max-w-[280px] h-[520px] bg-[#e8f7f2] text-[#061c15] rounded-xl shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between p-6 transform rotate-[-1deg] lg:-translate-x-3 hover:rotate-0 hover:-translate-y-6 transition-all duration-500 cursor-pointer group\" style=\"border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-serif-custom italic font-medium\">04 // Equilibrium</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-[#82a89c] group-hover:rotate-90 transition-transform duration-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-center items-center flex-grow py-8\">\n                        <div class=\"vertical-text font-serif-custom text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight whitespace-nowrap opacity-90 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\">\n                            Mutual Horizon\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end border-t border-[#061c15]/10 pt-4\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold\">Symmetry Aligned</span>\n                        <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#061c15]\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Bookmark 4 (Sage Green Detailed Manifesto Card) -->\n                <div class=\"w-full max-w-[280px] h-[520px] bg-[#7aa897] text-[#061c15] rounded-xl shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between p-6 transform rotate-[2deg] lg:-translate-x-6 hover:rotate-0 hover:-translate-y-6 transition-all duration-500 cursor-pointer group\" style=\"border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-serif-custom italic font-medium\">Ethos</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest opacity-60\">Manifesto</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 py-6\">\n                        <p class=\"font-serif-custom text-sm md:text-md leading-relaxed text-[#061c15] opacity-95\">\n                            By prioritizing deep systemic health over speculative indexes, we design adaptive mechanisms that protect families and balance ecosystems.\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"font-serif-custom text-sm md:text-md leading-relaxed text-[#061c15] opacity-95\">\n                            Resilience is built upon total validation. We secure trust in every transaction layer.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end border-t border-[#061c15]/10 pt-4\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-serif-custom italic\">Aether Philosophy</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:info-circle-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-[#061c15]/80\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FOOTER SECTION (Harmonized to Forest Green) -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-[#040f0c] text-[#82a89c] py-16 border-t border-white/5 relative z-10\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-[#e1f5ee]\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                    <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"45\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 6\"></circle>\n                    <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"10\" fill=\"currentColor